    /// <summary>
    /// The model card associated with the model package. Since ModelPack- ageModelCard is tied to a model package, it is a specific usage of a model card and its schema is simplified compared to the schema of ModelCard . The ModelPackageModelCard schema does not include model_package_details , and model_overview is composed of the model_creator and model_artifact properties. For more information about the model package model card schema, see Model package model card schema . For more information about the model card associated with the model package, see View the Details of a Model Version . ModelCardContent -&gt; (string) The content of the model card. The content must follow the schema described in Model Package Model Card Schema . Constraints: o min: 0 o max: 100000 o pattern: .* ModelCardStatus -&gt; (string) The approval status of the model card within your organization. Different organizations might have different criteria for model card review and approval. o Draft : The model card is a work in progress. o PendingReview : The model card is pending review. o Approved : The model card is approved. o Archived : The model card is archived. No more updates can be made to the model card content. If you try to update the model card content, you will receive the message Model Card is in Archived state . Possible values: o Draft o PendingReview o Approved o Archived Shorthand Syntax: ModelCardContent=string,ModelCardStatus=string JSON Syntax: { "ModelCardContent": "string", "ModelCardStatus": "Draft"|"PendingReview"|"Approved"|"Archived" }
    /// </summary>
    [CliOption("--model-card")]
    public string? ModelCard { get; set; }

    /// <summary>
    /// A structure describing the current state of the model in its life cycle. Stage -&gt; (string) [required] The current stage in the model life cycle. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 63 o pattern: [a-zA-Z0-9](-*[a-zA-Z0-9]){0,62} StageStatus -&gt; (string) [required] The current status of a stage in model life cycle. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 63 o pattern: [a-zA-Z0-9](-*[a-zA-Z0-9]){0,62} StageDescription -&gt; (string) Describes the stage related details. Constraints: o min: 0 o max: 1024 o pattern: .{0,1024} Shorthand Syntax: Stage=string,StageStatus=string,StageDescription=string JSON Syntax: { "Stage": "string", "StageStatus": "string", "StageDescription": "string" }
    /// </summary>
    [CliOption("--model-life-cycle")]
    public string? ModelLifeCycle { get; set; }

    /// <summary>
    /// A unique token that guarantees that the call to this API is idempo- tent. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 36 o pattern: [a-zA-Z0-9-]+
    /// </summary>
    [SecretValue]
    [CliOption("--client-token")]
    public string? ClientToken { get; set; }

